{"title":"Gorrsa","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Gorrsa is a named <a href=\"#/monster/basilisk-gazebound\">Gazebound Basilisk</a> seen at level 28.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Gorrsa</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Stonegaze Sanctum</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 3×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5704\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"gorrsa\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"basilisk-scale\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a5ed9e1dc0e4fec30424.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Scale</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-kryss\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f34cb12d01760f5e9019.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Gazebound Basilisks</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/vell\">Vell</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/322b545c7a280222aa18.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Gorrsa</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/basilisk-gazebound\">Gazebound Basilisk</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>28</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>359</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}